sequenceDiagram
    title UC-AUDIT: Auditoría Aleatoria 5% Anti-Sesgo

    participant SYS as Sistema BIOMED
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant WS as WebSocket
    actor SUP as Supervisor

    Note over SYS: Trigger: sample entra a pending_signature

    SYS->>PG: SELECT chromosomes WHERE sample_id=X AND confidence_score >= 0.86
    PG-->>SYS: Lista cromosomas "verdes" (auto-aceptados)
    SYS->>SYS: Random sample 5% de cromosomas verdes
    SYS->>PG: INSERT audit_tasks (chromosome_ids, supervisor_id, due_at)

    SYS->>WS: Notifica supervisor: "5% para auditoría aleatoria"
    WS-->>SUP: "Revisar N cromosomas seleccionados"

    loop Auditoría de cada cromosoma seleccionado
        SUP->>SYS: GET /chromosomes/{id}/detail
        SYS-->>SUP: Cromosoma + clasificación IA + Grad-CAM disponible

        alt Supervisor aprueba clasificación
            SUP->>SYS: POST /audit/{id}/approve
            SYS->>PG: INSERT edits (action="audit_approve", user_id=supervisor_jwt)
        else Supervisor detecta error
            SUP->>SYS: POST /audit/{id}/reject {correction}
            SYS->>PG: UPDATE chromosome (pair_number=correction, validated=false)
            SYS->>PG: INSERT edits (action="audit_reject")
            Note over SYS,PG: Devuelve muestra a pending_validation
        end
    end

    SYS->>PG: UPDATE audit_tasks SET completed=true
    Note over SYS: Anti-sesgo: previene confianza ciega en IA
